    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/3238219f0638d488ae775d91eb45d97e.avif?t=1673301292\" /></div><br><br>Venture into a bizarre kingdom plagued with great evil and dry humor. Explore a vibrant open world and fight through a campaign of crazy characters and wild quests to save the world.<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take on a variety of challenges</h2>The Odd Kingdom is constantly changing, and you must adapt to each quest you take on. Switch to first-person to scale mountains with a grappling hook, fine-tune your movement to navigate past a dungeon\u2019s traps, or even get a top-down perspective to cook in a restaurant.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.webm?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.mp4?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a lore (and comedy)-rich world</h2>With each place you discover and person you meet, you\u2019ll learn more about the mysterious past of the Odd Kingdom. Each interaction you have will bring you new insights, and laughs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/c555e7e89eda496c27faad0cf9a61a3a.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/c555e7e89eda496c27faad0cf9a61a3a.webm?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/c555e7e89eda496c27faad0cf9a61a3a.mp4?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Customize your combat</h2>From Barbecue Masters to Math Teachers, Pastry Lords to Unicorns, every class has a unique gimmick that changes the way you play. And with a wide-range of weapons to choose from, each with a unique ability, your fighting style can take on any shape.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/83655baf7ac71967670ed0f14d845209.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/83655baf7ac71967670ed0f14d845209.webm?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/83655baf7ac71967670ed0f14d845209.mp4?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Be a completionist\u2014well, if you WANT to be\u2026</h2>The \u201cnotebook\u201d is your most trusted tool. As you discover more about the Kingdom and the people within it, your notebook will fill up with more and more lore about the world you\u2019re trying to save. Explore every inch of the Kingdom to light \u201cbraziers,\u201d which doll out boones of trivia, history, and achievements for each one you find.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/e8e7b106289113883f4b948c53a0e534.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/e8e7b106289113883f4b948c53a0e534.webm?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/e8e7b106289113883f4b948c53a0e534.mp4?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/3238219f0638d488ae775d91eb45d97e.avif?t=1673301292\" /></div><br><br>Venture into a bizarre kingdom plagued with great evil and dry humor. Explore a vibrant open world and fight through a campaign of crazy characters and wild quests to save the world.<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Take on a variety of challenges</h2>The Odd Kingdom is constantly changing, and you must adapt to each quest you take on. Switch to first-person to scale mountains with a grappling hook, fine-tune your movement to navigate past a dungeon\u2019s traps, or even get a top-down perspective to cook in a restaurant.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.webm?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/33f7f56b0f40769166087b649052d973.mp4?t=1673301292\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Explore a lore (and comedy)-rich world</h2>With each place you discover and person you meet, you\u2019ll learn more about the mysterious past of the Odd Kingdom. Each interaction you have will bring you new insights, and laughs.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/c555e7e89eda496c27faad0cf9a61a3a.poster.avif?t=1673301292\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1651850/extras/c555e7e89eda496c27faad